  "notes": [
    "The cbETH/WETH pool is an immutable clone of the legacy ERC20Pool master, so its creation is the reset. Pools of the newer master 0x4b3b9a97 were hit later in the same campaign; the anchor did not execute them, so they are not targets.",
    "Campaign: every successful pool-touching transaction of the twelve EOAs running self-kick attacks across 16 pools, through the last recurrence found. Keeper takes of the attackers' auctions are not exploit transactions and are excluded.",
    "Loss is the pools' quote depletion over anchor and campaign; collateral the attackers left behind is not subtracted, and the mwstETH pool's wstETH quote is measured apart from pools holding wstETH as collateral."
